{"id": "4151", "type": "page", "slug": "go-vegan-now", "path": "go-vegan-now", "title": "Go Vegan Now", "date": "2025-04-16 10:24:58", "modified": "2025-06-24 14:32:12", "excerpt": "", "content": "<h1>Are You Ready To Go Vegan?</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"2500\" height=\"779\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/tripadvisor.svg\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Hippocrates Wellness</h3><p>TripAdvisor Rating</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGo Vegan Now\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>What does it mean to \"go vegan\"?\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n<p>Making the decision to go vegan means that your lifestyle is a daily, conscious effort to impart the least amount of harm to your own health by refusing all animal products as food, and to animals, by avoiding their exploitation in ways that cause harm, suffering, or unnecessary death.&nbsp;</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>FOR YOUR HEALTH\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Diets containing animal products are harmful to your health. According to a study published in 2016 by JAMA International Medicine, \"High animal protein intake was positively associated with cardiovascular mortality and high-plant protein intake was inversely associated with all-cause and cardiovascular mortality, especially among individuals with at least one lifestyle risk factor.\"</p><p><em>Song M, Fung TT, Hu FB, et al. Association of Animal and Plant Protein Intake With All-Cause and Cause-Specific Mortality. JAMA Intern Med. 2016;176(10):1453–1463. doi:10.1001/jamainternmed.2016.4182</em></p><picture><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=655&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=982&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=525&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=788&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=652&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=690&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=1035&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1px) and (max-width: 575px)\" /></picture>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"982\" height=\"655\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/04.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"982\" height=\"655\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/stuffed_mushroom_pic_by_andre-s_jime-nez_0036-1024x683-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>FOR THE PLANET\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>When you consume animal products, you are contributing to a system that is harming our planet. The greenhouse gasses attributed to livestock are more than double that from all transportation. The deforestation of the Amazon (80%) and other parts of the world are attributed to cattle being raised for food. Additionally, livestock are fed 35% of world's grains while millions of humans are starving each day. </p><p><em>Steinfeld, Henning. Livestock's Long Shadow: Environmental Issues and Options. Rome: Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations, 2006. Print.</em></p><picture><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=655&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=982&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=525&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=788&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=652&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=690&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=1035&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1px) and (max-width: 575px)\" /></picture><picture><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=655&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=982&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=525&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=788&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=652&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=690&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=1035&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1px) and (max-width: 575px)\" /></picture>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>FOR THE PLANET\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>When you consume animal products, you are contributing to a system that is harming our planet. The greenhouse gasses attributed to livestock are more than double that from all transportation. The deforestation of the Amazon (80%) and other parts of the world are attributed to cattle being raised for food. Additionally, livestock are fed 35% of world's grains while millions of humans are starving each day. </p><p><em>Steinfeld, Henning. Livestock's Long Shadow: Environmental Issues and Options. Rome: Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations, 2006. Print.</em></p><picture><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=655&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=982&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=525&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=788&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=652&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=690&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=1035&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1px) and (max-width: 575px)\" /></picture><picture><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=655&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=982&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=525&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=788&amp;rnd=132946064524470000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=132946064524470000, /media/4ymjgke5/istock-1016998356.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=652&amp;rnd=132946064524