99px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=690&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=1035&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=133087328009500000, /media/x1xpkymf/04.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=133087328009500000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1px) and (max-width: 575px)\" /></picture>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"982\" height=\"655\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/istock-1016998356.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Let's do vegan... together.\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Hippocrates has been pioneering the world of vegan nutrition since the 1950's. You have many options when switching to a plant-based diet, however, not all of those options are healthy. Don't fall into the trap of what many call \"junk food veganism\" which can lead to deficiencies and ailments.</p><p>We are the experts when it comes to adopting a healthy, whole food, nutrient-dense, vegan diet. Doing so will help you achieve maximum wellness in all areas of your life. </p> \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Learn with us.\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Make the switch to vegan with confidence by participating in our Life Transformation Program at our beautiful retreat center in West Palm Beach, Florida. The lives that will be transformed will not only be your own, but those of future generations that will reap the benefits of a healthier, kinder, and more conscious planet.  </p><p>At Hippocrates Wellness (HHI), we have spent more than six decades structuring the absolute best and most comprehensive, effective and affordable vegan health and wellness program possible.</p><section id=\"Block_FreeGuide\"> </section>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Download the free Vegan Food Combining Guide\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Combining food in the most beneficial way for human health is a new science with two overriding principles:</p><p>1. Foods are chemicals, and combinations of chemicals produce different effects.</p><p>2. We all digest food at various rates in various acid and alkaline environments.</p><p><strong>Please fill out the information here to receive your free guide.</strong></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<iframe id=\"ssf_S05NtUgysjDWNUhNMdI1SUtK1E1MNrbUNU8xNzZNTTYzSbNIBAA\" data-form-id=\"S05NtUgysjDWNUhNMdI1SUtK1E1MNrbUNU8xNzZNTTYzSbNIBAA\" data-instance-id=\"9tatyl\" src=\"https://app-3QNNGVUVKI.marketingautomation.services/prospector/form/MzawMLEwNjMxBgA/S05NtUgysjDWNUhNMdI1SUtK1E1MNrbUNU8xNzZNTTYzSbNIBAA?_usePlaceholders=true&amp;rf__sb=https%3A%2F%2Fhippocratesdev.wpenginepowered.com%2Fgo-vegan-now%2F&amp;agentreferrer__sb=https%3A%2F%2Fhippocratesdev.wpenginepowered.com%2Fgo-vegan-now%2F&amp;_tk=202504|67fd366a4cb078387833d9c9&amp;instance=9tatyl\" style=\"overflow-y: auto;\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"267\" width=\"100%\"></iframe>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/best-of-raw-1.jpg\" alt=\"best-of-raw\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/chamber-of-commerce-1.jpg\" alt=\"chamber-of-commerce\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hispanic-chamber-of-commerce-1.jpg\" alt=\"hispanic-chamber-of-commerce\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ispa-1.jpg\" alt=\"ispa\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/spas-of-america-1.jpg\" alt=\"spas-of-america\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-con